  "body": "28 Mata Lane Stanmore Bay:\r\n* A modern freehold home in Stanmore Bay with a layout that gives you options. \r\n* The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flows out to a private deck, ideal for a quiet coffee or a weekend BBQ.\r\n* A downstairs bedroom makes a handy home office or guest room, with a separate toilet nearby. \r\n* Upstairs are two more bedrooms, including the main bedroom with its own ensuite, plus a family bathroom.\r\n* With off-street parking and Stanmore Bay Village close by, this is a practical choice for a first home.\r\n\r\n(The photos taken from 18 Mata Lane. For Reference ONLY (Photo 1-14))\r\n\r\n\r\n41, 45 Mata Lane Stanmore Bay:\r\n* Three Bedrooms & Three Ensuites. \r\n* Having an ensuite for every bedroom makes everyday life a little easier. \r\n* These freehold terraces in Stanmore Bay each offer three bedrooms with their own bathrooms, plus a separate guest toilet and a single garage.\r\n* Set across three levels, the layout gives everyone room to spread out. \r\n* There's a bedroom with its own ensuite on the ground floor, handy for guests or extended family. \r\n* The middle level brings the kitchen, dining and living areas together, with a separate toilet for visitors. \r\n* Upstairs are two more bedrooms, each with its own ensuite.\r\n* Stanmore Bay Village, local cafes and beaches are close by. \r\n\r\n(The photos taken from 43 Mata Lane. For Reference ONLY (Photos 15 - 32))\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a home that makes sharing easy while giving everyone their own space, come and see how this layout works in person.",
